    "notes": "Collected on 2026-05-10. Chinese name (佳馥梅) confirmed from Parliament of Singapore official website. Wikidata QID: Q97292159. BCG title updated to Managing Director and Senior Partner per recent BCG and LinkedIn sources. GPC Health Chair appointment confirmed from CNA July 2025 report. Also serves as GPC Social and Family Development member. Electoral results: 2020 GE 67.29% (vs NSP), 2025 GE 67.75% (vs SDP+NSP, three-cornered fight). Father was Malay language teacher who also did translation work; mother was a nurse. MENDAKI Scholarship at age 13 from DPM Goh Chok Tong. Stanford Terman Award recipient. Harvard HBS Jackson C Tai Family Fellow. Board positions: GovTech, Sentosa Development Corporation, RGS Board of Governors. CFE member and Future Connectivity Sub-committee Co-Chair (2016). Women@BCG Southeast Asia lead."
